11
01:14:56,250 --> 01:15:02,250
Close My Eyes is a 1991 British drama film written and directed by Stephen Poliakoff and starring
Alan Rickman, Clive Owen and Saskia Reeves as well as Lesley Sharp and Karl Johnson.

12
01:21:45,000 --> 01:21:51,000
Music was by Michael Gibbs and the film was produced for
Beambright and FilmFour International by Therese Pickard.

13
01:28:33,750 --> 01:28:39,750
It had a limited theatrical release from 6 September 1991, before being
shown in Channel 4's Film on Four strand on 28 October 1993.

14
01:35:22,500 --> 01:35:28,500
The film explores themes of river thames, wheelchair,
marriage, forbidden love, based on play or musical.

15
01:42:11,250 --> 01:42:17,250
The tone is emotional.
